00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:23.230
He can't find his BlackBerry.
他找不到他的黑莓手机了。

322
00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:27.030
And Dwight is convinced that Jim is going to make fun of his group.
而德怀特认定吉姆会嘲笑他的团队。

323
00:13:27.550 --> 00:13:27.630
Yeah.
没错。

324
00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:29.830
Jim has stumbled upon something.
吉姆偶然发现了些什么。

325
00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:30.930
He's quite smug.
他显得相当自鸣得意。

326
00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:33.350
But he ultimately doesn't do anything.
但他最终什么也没做。

327
00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:34.550
For once.
破天荒头一次。

328
00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:37.930
Although I'm sure he's filing it away for later use.
虽然我敢肯定他已经把它记在心里，留待以后使用了。

329
00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:42.430
We had a fan question from Celine B in Century, Florida.
我们收到了一位来自佛罗里达州森丘市的粉丝席琳·B的提问。

330
00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:48.170
Is there any backstory for why the Knights of the Night t-shirts say we are unarmed on the back?
“暗夜骑士”T恤背后写着“我们未携带武器”，这背后有什么故事吗？

331
00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:54.830
And then other people wrote in, Ange, to comment that the Knights of the Night look quite a bit like Devo.
然后还有其他人写信来，安吉，评论说“暗夜骑士”看起来很像迪沃乐队。

332
00:13:55.590 --> 00:13:56.590
Oh, yes.
哦，没错。

333
00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.470
I did a side-by-side.
我做了个对比图。

334
00:13:58.770 --> 00:13:59.890
Oh, I love Devo.
哦，我爱迪沃乐队。

335
00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:00.870
Remember Devo?
还记得迪沃乐队吗？

336
00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:01.730
Anyone out there?
外面还有人记得吗？

337
00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:02.310
Whip it.
甩起来。

338
00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:03.190
Whip it good.
用力甩。

339
00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:03.870
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

340
00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:04.890
Try to detect it.
试着去察觉它。

341
00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:05.870
It's not too late.
现在还不算太晚。

342
00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:07.530
Whip, whip, whip, whip, whip.
甩，甩，甩，甩，甩。

343
00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:09.030
Crack that whip.
挥动那条鞭子。

344
00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:10.250
Here you go.
给你。

345
00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:10.930
Yes.
是的。

346
00:14:11.170 --> 00:14:13.210
That is Knights of the Night along with Devo.
这就是“暗夜骑士”和迪沃乐队的对比。

347
00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:18.430
And a great screen grab of Edward Nilsson III from our crew.
还有一张我们剧组爱德华·尼尔森三世的精彩截图。

348
00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:19.090
Yes.
是的。

349
00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:20.730
One minute, 17 seconds.
一分十七秒处。

350
00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:22.010
He is one of the Knights.
他就是其中一名骑士。

351
00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:24.350
He's in the front row closest to the windows.
他在前排，离窗户最近的地方。

352
00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:25.830
It was so fun to see him there.
看到他在那儿真有意思。

353
00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:26.310
I know.
我知道。

354
00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:31.030
Well, the shirts and the red beanies were a script note.
嗯，衬衫和红色毛线帽是剧本里的要求。

355
00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:33.490
The script note did not say anything about Devo.
剧本里可没提迪沃乐队（Devo）的事。

356
00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:34.890
It said simply, quote,
上面只写了，引用如下：

357
00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:38.850
A man in black walks by in a red beanie, nods to Jim.
一个穿黑衣戴红毛线帽的男人走过，向吉姆点头示意。

358
00:14:39.130 --> 00:14:42.370
His shirt reads, Knights of the Night, and on the back, we are unarmed.
他的衬衫上写着“夜之骑士”，背面写着“我们未携带武器”。

359
00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:44.130
Jim looks to camera.
吉姆看向镜头。

360
00:14:44.430 --> 00:14:48.790
In the conference room are Dwight and eight other men, including Nate, dressed the same.
会议室里坐着德怀特和其他八个男人，包括内特，他们穿着同样的衣服。

361
00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:51.470
Dwight kind of alludes to this in his talking head.
德怀特在单人采访中暗示了这一点。

362
00:14:51.610 --> 00:14:57.830
The Knights of the Night were a spin on the group, the Guardian Angels, who wore red berets
“夜之骑士”这个组织是参考了“守护天使”组织，他们戴着红色贝雷帽

363
00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:00.990
and white shirts with the Guardian Angels logo.
穿着印有“守护天使”标志的白衬衫。

364
00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:08.010
They were founded in New York in 1979 as an unarmed volunteer crime prevention organization.
他们于1979年在纽约成立，是一个非武装的志愿者犯罪预防组织。

365
00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:09.510
So...
所以……

366
00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:11.330
Kind of like a neighborhood watch in a way.
某种程度上就像社区巡逻队。

367
00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:12.010
Yes, exactly.
是的，没错。

368
00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:12.570
But with outfits.
但有统一制服。

369
00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:13.450
Yes, exactly.
是的，没错。

370
00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:13.770
Okay.
好吧。

371
00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:14.770
So that's it.
就是这样。

372
00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:17.970
I feel like mom detectives might call on Knights of the Night.
我觉得“妈妈侦探”可能会求助于“夜之骑士”。

373
00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:19.270
Oh.
噢。

374
00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:20.330
For backup?
寻求支援？

375
00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:21.030
Maybe.
也许吧。

376
00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:23.310
If we knew Dwight, we might.
如果我们认识德怀特的话，可能会。

377
00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:23.890
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

378
00:15:23.890 --> 00:15:26.130
I recognized a familiar face.
我认出了一张熟悉的面孔。

379
00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:29.410
The leader of the Knights of the Night is Seamus McCarthy.
“夜之骑士”的领头人是谢默斯·麦卡锡。

380
00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:31.410
I've known Seamus for years.
我认识谢默斯很多年了。

381
00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:32.650
We've done improv together.
我们一起做过即兴表演。

382
00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:34.010
We've performed at IOS.
我们在IOS演出过。

383
00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:35.870
He is hilarious.
他非常搞笑。

384
00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:42.570
And one of my favorite things about his Instagram, which is I am Seamus McCarthy, is he takes photos
我最喜欢他Instagram账号（账号名是I am Seamus McCarthy）的一点是，他会拍照记录

385
00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:47.590
of his coffee order and how people interpret Seamus.
他点的咖啡，以及人们是怎么拼写“谢默斯”（Seamus）这个名字的。

386
00:15:47.850 --> 00:15:48.450
His name?
他的名字？

387
00:15:48.450 --> 00:15:49.010
Yes.
对。

388
00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:54.070
And there's just a series of photos of different spellings.
有一系列照片展示了各种不同的拼写方式。

389
00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:55.250
It's really funny to me.
我觉得特别好笑。

390
00:15:57.280 --> 00:16:00.400
When the episode begins, we have a Michael talking head.
剧集开始时，有一个迈克尔的单人采访。

391
00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:05.180
It is January 3rd, 2011, a day that we'll live in famously.
那是2011年1月3日，注定要名垂青史的一天。

392
00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:08.000
I looked up January 3rd, 2011.
我查了一下2011年1月3日。

393
00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:09.540
What'd you find out?
你查到了什么？

394
00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:12.320
I wanted to know if there was anything in famously about it.
我想知道那天到底有什么名垂青史的事。

395
00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:12.680
Okay.
好吧。

396
00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:17.080
According to the internet, first thing you should know is it was a Monday.
根据互联网上的信息，首先你应该知道那天是星期一。

397
00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:17.900
Okay.
好吧。

398
00:16:17.900 --> 00:16:22.820
Here are the top five songs in the USA on January 3rd, 2011.
以下是2011年1月3日美国排名前五的歌曲。

399
00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:24.840
Bruno Mars, Grenade.
布鲁诺·马尔斯的《Grenade》。

400
00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:26.920
Katy Perry, Firework.
凯蒂·佩里的《Firework》。

401
00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:28.920
Kesha, We Are Who We Are.
Kesha的《We Are Who We Are》。

402
00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:31.040
Rihanna, What's My Name?
Rihanna的《What's My Name?》。

403
00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:33.080
And Pink, Raise Your Glass.
还有Pink的《Raise Your Glass》。

404
00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:36.960
Kick-Ass, directed by Matthew Vaughn, was one of the most viewed movies.
马修·沃恩执导的《海扁王》是观看次数最多的电影之一。

405
00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:41.440
And I Remember Nothing by Nora Ephron was one of the best-selling books.
诺拉·艾芙隆的《我心深处》是畅销书之一。

406
00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:42.440
Okay.
好的。

407
00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:47.680
The only thing that Michael is worried about is whether or not Holly is engaged.
迈克尔唯一担心的是霍莉是否已经订婚了。

408
00:16:48.460 --> 00:16:50.400
And he's kind of freaking out.
他有点抓狂了。

409
00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:54.840
We're going to do that thing where we think we're doing a private talking head, but the
我们要拍那种以为自己在进行私人访谈的镜头，但

410
00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:59.720
camera's going to pull out to reveal that Aaron is there and she's filming him because he's
摄像机会拉远，揭示亚伦就在那里，她正在拍他，因为他

411
00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:04.580
going to make both a sad video and a happy video where he's talking to himself.
要录制一段悲伤的视频和一段快乐的视频，在视频里他是在对自己说话。

412
00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:05.500
Yes.
没错。

413
00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:08.260
Because the only person that can talk Michael down is Michael.
因为唯一能劝住迈克尔的人就是迈克尔自己。

414
00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:08.860
Yeah.
是啊。

415
00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:15.620
If you notice, the video camcorder that Aaron is using, it's a little bit of old tech.
如果你注意看的话，亚伦用的那台摄像机，是有点老旧的技术了。

416
00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:19.840
And I can tell you who walked away with that old tech video camcorder and still has it to
我可以告诉你是谁拿走了那台老式摄像机，并且一直保留到

417
00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:20.300
this day.
今天。

418
00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:21.100
Who is it?
是谁？

419
00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:22.240
Randy Cordray.
兰迪·科德雷。

420
00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:23.200
Randy!
兰迪！

421
00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:23.900
Yes.
是的。

422
00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:28.540
He said that Phil Shea gave it to him when he left the series at the end of season seven.
他说菲尔·谢在第七季结束离开剧组时把它给了他。

423
00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:33.940
The camera, the case, the extra batteries, all the lenses, he still has it and he has
摄像机、机箱、备用电池、所有的镜头，他都还留着，而且他

424
00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:37.820
used that tiny camcorder for insert shots on other series he's produced.
在自己制作的其他剧集中还用过那台小摄像机拍摄插入镜头。

425
00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:42.520
He said that is his confessional to us, but he agreed that I could share it with you all.
他说这是他私下告诉我们的，但他同意我可以和你们大家分享。

426
00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:47.680
So when you want to know what did Randy get when he left, he got this camcorder.
所以当你想知道兰迪离开时得到了什么，他得到了这台摄像机。

427
00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:48.420
Wow.
哇。

428
00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:53.640
Well, he also shared that the video footage you see of Michael was really shot on that
嗯，他还分享说，你们看到的迈克尔的视频片段真的是用那台

429
00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:54.240
little camera.
小摄像机拍摄的。

430
00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:54.640
Yeah.
是啊。

431
00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:56.440
Pam has a big idea.
帕姆有个大点子。

432
00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:58.920
She's coming in hot today.
她今天来势汹汹。

433
00:17:59.180 --> 00:17:59.900
Yeah, she is.
没错，确实是。

434
00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:04.620
She has made a giant board with lots of glitter.
她做了一个巨大的板子，上面有很多亮粉。

435
00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:07.180
I mean, the glitter is blinding.
我是说，那亮粉简直闪瞎眼。

436
00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:08.340
It really is.
确实如此。

437
00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:09.400
There's so much.
太多了。

438
00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:09.960
It's blinding Angela.
它闪得安吉拉都看不清了。

439
00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:15.280
There's like a combo Dwight-Angela sass in this moment because Dwight says, did your baby
这一刻德怀特和安吉拉简直是联合起来讽刺人，因为德怀特说，是你孩子

440
00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:15.740
draw it?
画的吗？

441
00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:18.360
And then Angela's like, the glitter is blinding.
然后安吉拉就说，那亮粉闪得人眼花。

442
00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:20.560
They're such jerks to Pam.
他们对帕姆真是太刻薄了。

443
00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:26.160
Pam wants everybody to write a New Year's resolution and then she's going to display them
帕姆想让每个人都写下新年愿望，然后她会把它们展示在

444
00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:28.440
on her glittery resolution board.
她那块闪闪发光的愿望板上。

445
00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:30.820
Well, you know who she was inspired by.
嗯，你知道她是受谁启发了吧。

446
00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:31.800
Sue.
苏。

447
00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:34.420
Sue in Vance Refrigeration.
万斯制冷公司的苏。

448
00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:35.180
Yeah.
是啊。

449
00:18:35.540 --> 00:18:37.380
Sue has a motivation board.
苏有一个激励板。

450
00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:38.120
Yeah.
没错。

451
00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:44.160
Jenna, I always look in the candy bag alts to see who had the most alts for that episode.
珍娜，我总是会去翻糖果袋里的备选台词，看看那一集里谁的备选台词最多。

452
00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:44.700
Okay.
好的。

453
00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:46.320
It's usually Dwight.
通常都是德怀特。

454
00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:47.200
Yes.
没错。

455
00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:47.720
Right?
对吧？

456
00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:48.500
Makes sense.
说得通。

457
00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:50.400
This episode, it was Pam.
这一集里，是帕姆。

458
00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:52.780
Were they all Sue talking heads?
那些全是苏的采访镜头吗？

459
00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:55.540
They were all Sue and they were must shoot.
全是苏的，而且都是必须拍摄的。

460
00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:57.020
So you said all of this.
所以这些话全是你说的。

461
00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:58.380
Do you want to hear some of them?
你想听听其中的一些吗？

462
00:18:58.500 --> 00:18:59.380
I'll see if I remember.
我看看我还记不记得。

463
00:18:59.640 --> 00:18:59.920
Okay.
好的。

464
00:19:00.520 --> 00:19:02.460
If Sue can do it, why can't I?
如果苏能做到，为什么我不能呢？

465
00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:04.260
Sue's really cool.
苏真的很酷。

466
00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:05.980
Sue just goes for it.
苏就是那种敢作敢为的人。

467
00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:06.860
She's awesome.
她太棒了。

468
00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:10.300
Sue is like the happiest person I've ever met.
苏是我见过最快乐的人。

469
00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:12.700
I want to be the happiest person I've ever met.
我也想成为我见过最快乐的人。

470
00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:15.540
I sort of have a girl crush on Sue.
我对苏有点女生之间的崇拜。

471
00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:18.880
I want Sue to be my aunt or my best friend.
我希望苏能成为我的阿姨或者最好的朋友。

472
00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:20.260
Actually, I just want to be Sue.
其实，我只是想成为苏。

473
00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:22.640
And she makes her own sweaters.
而且她还会自己织毛衣。

474
00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:24.560
And she gave me the best sugar cookie ever.
她还给了我吃过最好吃的糖霜饼干。

475
00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:26.040
And Sue is just awesome.
苏简直太棒了。

476
00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:26.860
I love Sue.
我爱苏。

477
00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:32.220
She has three different scissors that cut three different patterns into construction paper.
她有三把不同的剪刀，能在手工纸上剪出三种不同的花样。

478
00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:35.260
How lame slash cool is that?
这到底是土气还是酷呢？

479
00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:38.140
I just want to steal a bunch of ideas from Sue.
我只想从苏那里偷学一堆点子。

480
00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:40.880
Then maybe come up with my own Sue type ideas.
然后也许能想出我自己那种苏式点子。

481
00:19:41.060 --> 00:19:42.940
Then maybe I'll become Sue.
然后也许我就能变成苏了。

482
00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:45.400
I want to be more like Sue.
我想变得更像苏。

483
00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:46.860
Everyone loves Sue.
每个人都喜欢苏。

