其中一个妈妈说，你女儿对我女儿真好。

977
00:39:00.410 --> 00:39:02.370
I just love their interaction.
我特别喜欢看她们互动。

978
00:39:02.570 --> 00:39:04.290
She was complimenting this woman's daughter.
她是在夸奖那个女人的女儿。

979
00:39:04.490 --> 00:39:07.390
And she said, oh, yeah, my daughter's nice to anyone.
结果对方说，哦，是啊，我女儿对谁都挺客气的。

980
00:39:07.930 --> 00:39:11.250
I was like, what?
我当时心想，什么鬼？

981
00:39:11.970 --> 00:39:15.010
And I saw the look on the original mom's face.
我看到了那个先开口的妈妈脸上的表情。

982
00:39:15.010 --> 00:39:19.570
And she made eye contact with me as if to say, did we both clock that?
她跟我对视了一眼，仿佛在说，我们都听出弦外之音了吧？

983
00:39:19.770 --> 00:39:19.970
Yeah.
是啊。

984
00:39:19.970 --> 00:39:20.030
Yeah.
没错。

985
00:39:20.590 --> 00:39:22.110
Just such a passive dig.
真是太阴阳怪气了。

986
00:39:22.390 --> 00:39:22.930
It is.
确实。

987
00:39:23.110 --> 00:39:24.030
Oh, my goodness.
天哪。

988
00:39:24.450 --> 00:39:24.790
Yes.
是的。

989
00:39:25.030 --> 00:39:27.070
Well, there's Michael's everywhere, you guys.
伙计们，到处都有迈克尔这样的人。

990
00:39:29.490 --> 00:39:34.010
Well, I think we should take a break because when we get back, the guys are going to arrive at the bookstore.
我觉得我们该休息一下了，因为回来之后，男士们就要到达书店了。

991
00:39:34.390 --> 00:39:37.570
And they're going to devise a plan to meet some ladies.
他们打算想个办法去结识一些女士。

992
00:39:37.970 --> 00:39:38.930
We'll be right back.
我们马上回来。

993
00:39:47.940 --> 00:39:49.100
We're in the bookstore.
我们现在在书店里。

994
00:39:49.820 --> 00:39:55.860
Did anyone else notice at nine minutes and 59 seconds how much the wind was blowing in the trees outside?
有没有人注意到在9分59秒的时候，外面的树被风吹得有多厉害？

995
00:39:56.360 --> 00:39:56.680
No.
没有。

996
00:39:56.880 --> 00:39:57.720
Was this just me?
难道只有我注意到了？

997
00:39:57.720 --> 00:39:59.000
It was a windy day?
那天风很大吗？

998
00:39:59.240 --> 00:39:59.940
Very windy.
风非常大。

999
00:40:00.380 --> 00:40:02.220
I went to the call sheet, Jenna.
我查了通告单，珍娜。

1000
00:40:02.680 --> 00:40:03.020
What?
什么？

1001
00:40:03.280 --> 00:40:03.600
Yeah.
是啊。

1002
00:40:04.040 --> 00:40:04.340
And?
然后呢？

1003
00:40:04.620 --> 00:40:08.180
Did it say, because it would say wind advisory.
上面写了吗？因为如果有的话，会写着大风预警的。

1004
00:40:08.680 --> 00:40:11.060
We filmed the scene around 11 a.m.
我们是在上午11点左右拍摄那场戏的。

1005
00:40:11.340 --> 00:40:13.660
on October 25th, 2010.
时间是2010年10月25日。

1006
00:40:14.180 --> 00:40:17.080
And the gusts were up to seven miles an hour that day.
那天阵风最高时速只有七英里。

1007
00:40:17.200 --> 00:40:18.100
Oh, my goodness.
天哪。

1008
00:40:18.360 --> 00:40:20.040
So there you go.
所以你看。

1009
00:40:20.440 --> 00:40:21.740
There was some wind.
确实有点风。

1010
00:40:21.740 --> 00:40:24.420
We had a fan question from Tori N.
我们收到了来自北卡罗来纳州康科德市Tori N.的一位粉丝提问。

1011
00:40:24.560 --> 00:40:26.580
in Concord, North Carolina.
北卡罗来纳州康科德市。

1012
00:40:26.580 --> 00:40:29.900
Tell us about Ellen, the bookstore lady.
跟我们讲讲书店女士艾伦吧。

1013
00:40:30.480 --> 00:40:31.440
That's right.
没错。

1014
00:40:31.680 --> 00:40:33.420
Daryl walks right up to a woman.
达里尔径直走向一个女人。

1015
00:40:33.620 --> 00:40:35.400
She has a tag that says Ellen.
她戴着写有“艾伦”字样的名牌。

1016
00:40:35.720 --> 00:40:40.080
And she's going to pitch the e-reader to Daryl.
她打算向达里尔推销电子阅读器。

1017
00:40:40.220 --> 00:40:42.080
They can hold 10,000 books.
它们能装下一万本书。

1018
00:40:42.080 --> 00:40:44.300
I mean, Daryl is blown away.
我是说，达里尔惊呆了。

1019
00:40:44.480 --> 00:40:45.660
He says it's so light.
他说它太轻了。

1020
00:40:45.660 --> 00:40:46.760
It's like a croissant.
就像个羊角面包一样。

1021
00:40:47.660 --> 00:40:49.740
Ellen was played by Martha Middleton.
艾伦是由玛莎·米德尔顿饰演的。

1022
00:40:50.040 --> 00:40:54.000
She has also appeared on To Tell the Truth as one of the impostors.
她还曾作为冒充者之一出现在《实话实说》节目中。

1023
00:40:54.000 --> 00:40:55.260
Oh, no way.
噢，不会吧。

1024
00:40:55.520 --> 00:40:55.740
Yes.
是的。

1025
00:40:55.900 --> 00:40:57.880
And also in the film, The Newcomers.
还出演过电影《新来者》。

1026
00:40:58.400 --> 00:41:00.920
Dwight and Andy are going to start scoping it out.
德怀特和安迪准备开始物色目标了。

1027
00:41:01.180 --> 00:41:02.500
They've gone upstairs.
他们上楼去了。

1028
00:41:02.780 --> 00:41:03.060
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1029
00:41:03.180 --> 00:41:03.540
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1030
00:41:03.840 --> 00:41:06.120
And a pretty lady is going to walk by.
然后一位漂亮的女士走了过去。

1031
00:41:06.940 --> 00:41:07.420
Yes.
没错。

1032
00:41:07.720 --> 00:41:11.000
They try to pick her up, but she mistakes them as employees.
他们试图搭讪，但她把他们误认为是店员。

1033
00:41:11.140 --> 00:41:12.860
They are doing a very bad job.
他们表现得太差劲了。

1034
00:41:13.180 --> 00:41:14.240
They're so awkward.
他们太尴尬了。

1035
00:41:14.740 --> 00:41:15.660
Guest star alert.
客串明星预警。

1036
00:41:15.860 --> 00:41:18.720
That bookstore customer is Ed's wife, Sarah.
那位书店顾客是艾德的妻子，莎拉。

1037
00:41:19.100 --> 00:41:19.500
Yeah.
是啊。

1038
00:41:19.780 --> 00:41:20.300
How about that?
怎么样？

1039
00:41:20.320 --> 00:41:23.120
I love how we would have our friends and family on the show.
我喜欢我们让亲朋好友上节目的方式。

1040
00:41:23.120 --> 00:41:24.300
Because you go back.
因为当你回首往事时。

1041
00:41:24.500 --> 00:41:25.660
And you have all these memories.
你会拥有所有这些回忆。

1042
00:41:25.740 --> 00:41:25.960
Yes.
是的。

1043
00:41:26.040 --> 00:41:29.100
Like how our camera assistant, Ed, was in the cold open.
就像我们的摄影助理艾德出现在开场戏里一样。

1044
00:41:29.120 --> 00:41:29.700
I know.
我知道。

1045
00:41:29.960 --> 00:41:30.200
At the beginning.
在开头的时候。

1046
00:41:30.380 --> 00:41:31.020
It's the beSt.
那真是太棒了。

1047
00:41:31.280 --> 00:41:35.420
We also had a fan catch from Emily J in Ohio and many others.
我们还收到了来自俄亥俄州Emily J以及其他许多人的粉丝发现。

1048
00:41:36.020 --> 00:41:39.440
At 10 minutes and 39 seconds, Angela, did you notice?
在10分39秒的时候，安吉拉，你注意到了吗？

1049
00:41:39.720 --> 00:41:43.220
There is a whole display of Joe Bennett's book.
那里有一整排乔·贝内特的书。

1050
00:41:43.620 --> 00:41:44.100
No.
没有。

1051
00:41:44.100 --> 00:41:45.360
It's a great detail.
这是一个很棒的细节。

1052
00:41:45.540 --> 00:41:46.560
Oh, that's so great.
噢，那太棒了。

1053
00:41:46.820 --> 00:41:49.260
That little detail was courtesy of Dave Rogers.
那个小细节是戴夫·罗杰斯的功劳。

1054
00:41:49.500 --> 00:41:50.320
That was his idea.
那是他的主意。

1055
00:41:50.680 --> 00:41:51.100
Dave.
戴夫。

1056
00:41:51.280 --> 00:41:51.540
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1057
00:41:51.540 --> 00:41:53.240
Who knows the show better than Dave?
谁能比戴夫更了解这部剧呢？

1058
00:41:53.440 --> 00:41:53.760
Nobody.
没人。

1059
00:41:54.000 --> 00:41:54.120
Nobody.
没人。

1060
00:41:54.960 --> 00:41:57.440
Next up, Phyllis is going to become a mom detective.
接下来，菲利斯要变身成一位妈妈侦探了。

1061
00:41:58.020 --> 00:41:59.540
She's got a salad to go.
她还带了一份沙拉。

1062
00:41:59.720 --> 00:42:01.300
She says, Aaron, follow my lead.
她说，亚伦，跟着我走。

1063
00:42:01.440 --> 00:42:01.680
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1064
00:42:02.440 --> 00:42:04.860
And she's going to share that she went to Portugal.
然后她会分享她去过葡萄牙的事。

1065
00:42:05.480 --> 00:42:05.960
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1066
00:42:06.200 --> 00:42:08.540
I was very intrigued by this.
我对这一点非常感兴趣。

1067
00:42:09.980 --> 00:42:12.620
Aaron, who's a horrible wingman, said, so did I.
亚伦，一个糟糕的僚机，说，我也去过。

1068
00:42:12.860 --> 00:42:13.800
I went to Portugal.
我也去过葡萄牙。

1069
00:42:14.140 --> 00:42:14.440
Yeah.
是啊。

1070
00:42:14.440 --> 00:42:15.540
And Holly's like, wow, together?
霍莉就说，哇，你们一起去的？

1071
00:42:15.940 --> 00:42:17.200
And Phyllis is like, no.
菲利斯就说，没有。

1072
00:42:18.200 --> 00:42:23.640
Yeah, they're sort of exchanging stories about what's happened over the new year.
是啊，他们正在交换关于新年期间发生的事情。

1073
00:42:23.820 --> 00:42:24.000
Yeah.
是啊。

1074
00:42:24.080 --> 00:42:25.360
They're trying to drag it out of Holly.
他们正试图从霍莉嘴里套话。

1075
00:42:25.540 --> 00:42:28.640
What happened that might be interesting about your new year?
你的新年里有什么有趣的事情发生吗？

1076
00:42:28.820 --> 00:42:29.220
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1077
00:42:29.620 --> 00:42:35.460
Holly gets it, and she says, yeah, I didn't uphold my ultimatum deadline.
霍莉明白了，她说，是的，我没有坚持我的最后通牒期限。

1078
00:42:35.700 --> 00:42:38.840
She said, but it was unfair of me to give him an ultimatum.
她说，但我给他下最后通牒是不公平的。

1079
00:42:38.840 --> 00:42:43.560
In the meantime, Dwight, Andy, and Daryl have ditched the bookstore.
与此同时，德怀特、安迪和达里尔离开了书店。

1080
00:42:43.880 --> 00:42:44.720
It didn't go well.
进展得并不顺利。

1081
00:42:45.620 --> 00:42:47.960
Dwight has driven them to a strip club.
德怀特开车把他们带到了一家脱衣舞俱乐部。

1082
00:42:48.100 --> 00:42:51.340
He said he is going to see his resolution through today.
他说他今天一定要实现他的新年决心。

1083
00:42:51.660 --> 00:42:56.340
I've got a little bit of location information about the strip club temptation.
我有一些关于“诱惑”脱衣舞俱乐部的选址信息。

1084
00:42:57.040 --> 00:42:57.400
Okay.
好的。

1085
00:42:57.760 --> 00:43:00.520
This was a real strip club in Northridge, California,
这是一家位于加州诺斯里奇的真实脱衣舞俱乐部，

1086
00:43:01.260 --> 00:43:05.380
and it was actually across the street from the roller rink.
而且它实际上就在溜冰场的对面。

1087
00:43:05.380 --> 00:43:11.080
Like, our locations manager, Kyle Alexander, managed to find this very specific thing,
我们的外景经理凯尔·亚历山大，竟然找到了这么具体的地方，

1088
00:43:11.240 --> 00:43:15.220
which was a strip club across the street from a roller rink.
也就是一家溜冰场对面的脱衣舞俱乐部。

1089
00:43:15.300 --> 00:43:17.260
That's just crazy luck.
这运气真是绝了。

1090
00:43:17.420 --> 00:43:18.560
Because I asked Randy.
因为我问了兰迪。

1091
00:43:18.760 --> 00:43:21.060
I said, oh, so did we have to make this?
我说，噢，所以这是我们搭建的吗？

1092
00:43:21.180 --> 00:43:23.440
Because surely that's, you know.
因为这肯定……你知道的。

1093
00:43:23.660 --> 00:43:24.700
Randy said no.
兰迪说没有。

1094
00:43:24.840 --> 00:43:26.160
He really found that location.
他真的找到了那个地方。

1095
00:43:26.400 --> 00:43:31.260
However, he said that the location did not look like a strip club.
不过，他说那个地方看起来并不像脱衣舞俱乐部。

1096
00:43:31.260 --> 00:43:33.100
It was just sort of a gray building.
它看起来就像一栋灰色的建筑。

1097
00:43:33.100 --> 00:43:38.400
The only sign telling you that it was temptation was a sign on a pole.
唯一能告诉你那是“诱惑”俱乐部的标志就是杆子上的招牌。

1098
00:43:38.840 --> 00:43:43.000
So they asked the club, can we kind of zhuzh up your exterior?
所以他们问俱乐部，我们能稍微装饰一下你们的外观吗？

1099
00:43:43.840 --> 00:43:47.440
Michael Gallenberg created that giant temptation sign.
迈克尔·加伦伯格制作了那个巨大的“诱惑”招牌。

1100
00:43:47.660 --> 00:43:48.720
I have a question.
我有个问题。

1101
00:43:48.960 --> 00:43:49.120
What?
什么？

1102
00:43:49.120 --> 00:43:50.880
Was it temptation or temptations?
是Temptation还是Temptations？

1103
00:43:51.740 --> 00:43:52.800
I'm just curious.
我只是好奇。

1104
00:43:52.800 --> 00:43:56.280
Just a background catch question for you guys.
只是顺便问问你们。

1105
00:43:56.420 --> 00:43:57.900
I think it's called temptation.
我觉得应该是Temptation。

1106
00:43:58.500 --> 00:43:58.860
Okay.
好吧。

1107
00:43:59.260 --> 00:44:00.160
Gentleman's Club.
绅士俱乐部。

1108
00:44:00.160 --> 00:44:00.940
One temptation.
一个诱惑。

1109
00:44:01.260 --> 00:44:02.900
There's only one per customer.
每位顾客只能有一个诱惑。

1110
00:44:03.100 --> 00:44:03.340
Okay.
好吧。

1111
00:44:03.680 --> 00:44:08.300
You know, there's one giant temptation, and it's coming into this club at all.
你知道，这里有一个巨大的诱惑，那就是走进这家俱乐部本身。

1112
00:44:08.420 --> 00:44:08.980
It's the flesh.
那就是肉体诱惑。

1113
00:44:09.560 --> 00:44:10.540
Yes, that's right.
没错，就是这样。

1114
00:44:10.900 --> 00:44:17.080
And Michael Gallenberg based that logo on the outside of the building on their real logo.
迈克尔·加伦伯格是根据他们真实的标志来设计大楼外面的那个标志的。

1115
00:44:17.300 --> 00:44:20.600
He painted the front of the building a combination of red and gray.
他把大楼正面刷成了红色和灰色的组合。

1116
00:44:21.300 --> 00:44:23.720
Randy even showed us the before and after pictures.
兰迪甚至给我们看了改造前后的照片。

1117
00:44:24.120 --> 00:44:26.740
It's a great zhuzh, I have to say.
不得不说，这装饰得真棒。

1118
00:44:27.280 --> 00:44:30.420
Randy said that after it was over, you know, it's in our contract.
兰迪说结束后，你知道的，合同里有规定。

1119
00:44:30.420 --> 00:44:33.220
We have to restore things to their original condition.
我们必须把东西恢复原状。

1120
00:44:33.620 --> 00:44:36.200
The managers of temptation said, no, thank you.
Temptation的经理说，不用了，谢谢。

1121
00:44:36.360 --> 00:44:36.820
Keep it up.
留着吧。

1122
00:44:36.920 --> 00:44:37.500
We love it.
我们很喜欢。

1123
00:44:37.680 --> 00:44:38.460
Well, yeah.
嗯，是啊。

1124
00:44:39.320 --> 00:44:40.960
But it is now closed.
但它现在已经关门了。

1125
00:44:41.040 --> 00:44:42.420
It doesn't exist anymore.
它已经不存在了。

1126
00:44:42.420 --> 00:44:44.060
It's an empty building for lease.
现在是一栋空楼，正在招租。

1127
00:44:44.240 --> 00:44:45.600
It's gray again now.
现在又变回灰色了。

1128
00:44:45.780 --> 00:44:48.120
So it's a blank slate waiting to be something.
所以它成了一张白纸，等待着成为别的东西。

1129
00:44:48.260 --> 00:44:48.800
Something new.
一些新的东西。

1130
00:44:48.940 --> 00:44:49.300
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

1131
00:44:49.960 --> 00:44:57.800
And incidentally, there is a Temptations nightclub in Scranton, but it is a dance club and bar.
顺便提一下，斯克兰顿确实有一家叫Temptations的夜店，但那是一家舞厅和酒吧。

1132
00:44:58.240 --> 00:44:59.960
There's no fleshy temptation.
那里没有肉体诱惑。

1133
00:44:59.960 --> 00:45:01.560
There's no singular temptation.
那里没有单一的诱惑。

1134
00:45:02.020 --> 00:45:02.340
That's right.
没错。

1135
00:45:02.900 --> 00:45:06.120
Daryl says, hold up, I don't have anything against strip clubs, but I don't really want
达里尔说，等等，我并不反对脱衣舞俱乐部，但我真的不想

1136
00:45:06.120 --> 00:45:07.540
to go on Monday at noon.
在周一中午去那里。

1137
00:45:07.920 --> 00:45:09.200
Yes, that's correct.
是的，没错。

1138
00:45:09.760 --> 00:45:13.500
Andy spots a roller skating rink and says, hey, how about there?
安迪发现了一个溜冰场，说，嘿，去那儿怎么样？

1139
00:45:13.640 --> 00:45:15.200
Single ladies at the rink.
溜冰场有单身女士。

1140
00:45:15.360 --> 00:45:16.020
Woo-hoo-hoo.
呜呼。

1141
00:45:16.720 --> 00:45:20.540
So they go, and they're the only three people there.
于是他们去了，结果他们是那里仅有的三个人。

1142
00:45:20.820 --> 00:45:21.080
Yeah.
是啊。

1143
00:45:21.140 --> 00:45:24.040
It's just the three of them skating around.
就他们三个人在滑来滑去。

